# MTK Fortune Teller - Environment Configuration Notice
#
# No environment variables or external API keys are required to build, run, or test this application.
#
# The application operates using:
# - embedded Myanmar 7-day numerology fortune dataset (FortuneData.kt)
# - local deterministic Mahabote & BayDin fortune engine
# - Solana Mobile Wallet Adapter (MWA) for Solana Devnet on-chain sealing
#
# No API keys (such as Gemini or third-party RPC keys) are needed for core functionality.
